// =============================================================================
// WorkforceOS — Database Schema
// =============================================================================
//
// This schema will be expanded in future phases:
//
//   Phase 1: Users, Companies, Roles, Sessions (Auth + Multi-tenancy)
//   Phase 2: Projects, Tasks, Attendance, Leave, Inventory, Payroll
//   Phase 3: Messages, Notifications, Subscriptions, Analytics
//
